## 第三方依赖许可证

DockFlowLab 使用了以下开源项目：

### AutoDock Vina
- License: Apache License 2.0
- Copyright: Scripps Research Institute
- URL: https://vina.scripps.edu/

### OpenBabel
- License: GNU General Public License v2
- Copyright: OpenBabel Development Team
- URL: http://openbabel.org/

### NGL Viewer
- License: MIT License
- Copyright: Alexander S. Rose
- URL: https://github.com/nglviewer/ngl
- 说明：2.5.0 版本原样打包于 `src/dockflowlab/resources/ngl/`

### Qt / PySide6（含 QtWebEngine）
- License: GNU Lesser General Public License v3
- Copyright: The Qt Company and Qt for Python contributors
- URL: https://www.qt.io/

### NumPy
