- Copyright: NumPy Developers
- URL: https://numpy.org/

### Pandas
- License: BSD 3-Clause License
- Copyright: Pandas Development Team
- URL: https://pandas.pydata.org/

### RDKit (可选依赖)
- License: BSD 3-Clause License
- Copyright: RDKit Contributors
- URL: https://www.rdkit.org/

### scikit-learn (可选依赖)
